{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064183/block/singleImage/3269494/df/01M7KXCPDVNJX6T0WHC7SMN4PV.jpeg?updatedAt=1794890993\"/><p>坪洲發生燒炭自殺案。 今日（17日）清晨7時41分，一名64歲姓樊男子被發現倒臥於坪洲坪利路休憩處處洗手間內。有途人行經該處時，赫然發現男子昏迷不醒，身旁更放有一盤燒過的炭，大驚報警求助。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，經檢驗後證實男子已經死亡，死因有待驗屍確定。警方隨後封鎖現場蒐證，於現場並未檢獲遺書，將案件列作「自殺」處理，正在調查其輕生原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:49:25.925618+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T04:49:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T03:52:28.538461+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T05:42:34.845308+00:00","content_hash":"14ece7483f01f8743cc347da5f65fa516cd3f04c87b5b87cc51ff2e6c32231eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T05:49:25.925618+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}